{"conversation_id":"24c8a077-8c56-4562-8841-3c1e9039fc56","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### Test Suite Results\n\n- **Test Files:** 11 passed (11 total)\n- **Tests:** 116 passed, 0 failed (116 total)\n- **TypeScript Typecheck:** Clean (`npx tsc --noEmit` exited with code 0)\n- **Git Commit \u0026 Push:** Pushed `f5b9fa5` to `origin/main`\n\n---\n\n### Root Cause per Finding\n\n- **A1 (Production Dependency Missing):** `typescript` was listed only under `devDependencies`, causing global production installs without dev dependencies to fail dynamically loading `pi-unify-cmd` modules in [`src/catalog.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/catalog.ts).\n- **A2 (Cross-Agent Deduplication):** [`src/dispatch.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/dispatch.ts) previously deduped commands across all agents using only `cmd.name.toLowerCase()`, hiding distinct commands sharing the same name from different agents and desynchronizing `list --json` from `ping` counts.\n- **A3 (Sync Warning on Skipped Commands):** [`src/sync.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/sync.ts) wrote directly to process streams instead of utilizing the injected `stderr` stream in [`SyncOptions`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/types.ts#L43-L47) / [`src/dispatch.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/dispatch.ts#L323-L330).\n- **A4 (Smoke Test Real Catalog Gate):** [`tests/smoke.test.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/tests/smoke.test.ts#L56-L75) did not gate on `CMD_PALLET_TEST_REAL_CATALOG === \"1\"` with an early return, running assertions unconditionally against non-existent real catalog paths.\n- **A6 (Honest Config Missing \u0026 Ping Exit):** [`loadCatalog`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/catalog.ts#L193-L240) fabricated a default all-agent configuration and nonexistent file path when no `unify-cmd.json` was present, rather than explicitly throwing a config error with exit code 2 in [`src/dispatch.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/dispatch.ts#L102).\n- **A8 (Sync Cross-Agent Overwrite):** [`syncSlashCommands`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/sync.ts#L25-L95) overwrote files when identical command slugs existed across multiple agents instead of qualifying colliding filenames as `${agent}-${slug}.md`, resulting in inaccurate synced counts.\n- **F9 (Unimplemented Cache TTL Documentation):** `CMD_PALLET_CACHE_TTL` was documented in [`src/verbs.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/verbs.ts) and [`README.md`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/README.md) despite caching being deliberately unimplemented.\n- **F10 (Exported Throwing Stub):** [`src/index.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/index.ts) re-exported a throwing stub `discoverCommands()` from [`src/catalog.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/catalog.ts).\n","duration_seconds":974.806947147,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":433986,"output_tokens":61914,"thinking_tokens":46023,"cache_read_tokens":8409360,"total_tokens":495900}}
